('Caterpillar','0R-1571','3408/3412 Reman Cylinder Pack','Cat Reman cylinder pack for 3408/3412 with 14.5:1 compression ratio. Preassembled liner, piston, rings, pin, retainers, connecting rod and seals.',ARRAY['3408','3412','3406']::text[],'Engine Overhaul','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/0R-1571','Official Cat product page identifies 3408/3412, 14.5:1 compression ratio and lists Marine Engine 3412 and Industrial Engine 3406 as compatible models.','REFERENCE',null,'{"compression_ratio":"14.5:1"}'::jsonb,ARRAY['3412','3406']::text[]),
