('Caterpillar','20R-7411','Reman Platinum Engine Overhaul Kit (C15)','Cat Reman C15 platinum overhaul kit includes Cat Reman cylinder heads, fuel injectors, water pump, oil pump and cylinder packs.',ARRAY['C15']::text[],'Engine Overhaul','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/20R-7411','Official Cat product page lists TRUCK ENGINE C15 and describes the included Reman assemblies.','REFERENCE',null,'{"compression_ratio":"18.0:1"}'::jsonb,ARRAY['C15']::text[]),
('Caterpillar','10R-4471','3516 Reman Cylinder Pack','Cat Reman 3516 cylinder pack, 8.0:1 compression ratio; Cat states cylinder packs are fully assembled and ready to install.',ARRAY['G3500','G3508','G3512','G3516']::text[],'Engine Overhaul','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/10R-4471','Official Cat product page identifies the 3516 Reman Cylinder Pack and lists Generator Set/Gas Engine G3508, G3512 and G3516.','REFERENCE',null,'{"compression_ratio":"8.0:1"}'::jsonb,ARRAY['G3508','G3512','G3516']::text[]),
